            <pubDate>Tue, 03 Aug 2021 21:17:44 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">window.alert()</code> <a href="https://www.chromestatus.com/feature/5148698084376576" rel="nofollow">doesn't work cross-origin in Chrome any more</a>, meaning that any of our live samples that rely on <code class="notranslate">alert()</code> are now broken.</p>
<p dir="auto">See also <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="959310145" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/7553" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/7553/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/7553">#7553</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This is (I think) all the live samples in Web/API that use <code class="notranslate">alert()</code> in a live sample (list now maintained by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena">@Josh-Cena</a>):</p>
